└── scripts/        # build / gate / automation
```

## Module Boundaries

Record the boundaries that the architecture gate enforces (ArchUnit / eslint
boundaries / import-linter, depending on stack). An agent must not cross these.

| Layer / Module | May depend on | Must NOT depend on |
| -------------- | ------------- | ------------------ |
| _domain_       | _nothing_     | _infra, web_       |
| _application_  | _domain_      | _web_              |
| _infra / web_  | _application_ | _other infra_      |

## Naming & Placement Conventions

- Tests live beside or mirror the unit under test.
- New files: run the refactor-first survey before adding one (does it already exist?).
- Generated files carry an arbiter marker — never hand-edit a generated artifact.

## Where to Look First

| If you are changing… | Start in… |
| -------------------- | --------- |
| business logic       | `src/` (domain/application) |
| a gate or check      | `scripts/` |
| project context      | `docs/steering/` (this file) |
| a feature spec       | `docs/specs/` |
| a bug                | `docs/bugs/` + `.evidence/` |
